# The papers graph: a second embedded Neo4j with its own store, so the
# reading lists and the Form 13 filings are separate data sources.
# Start it: bb local-papers (experiments/008's server, another home and port).
# Fill it:  WORKSHOP_ENV=papers-graph.env bb papers-load
NEO4J_URI=bolt://localhost:7689
NEO4J_USERNAME=neo4j
NEO4J_PASSWORD=not-checked
NEO4J_DATABASE=neo4j
AURA_INSTANCENAME=embedded, papers
